msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Alerta"

#: ../../tools/hpe_vm/virtual_machines.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Destroy** immediately kills the VM without graceful shutdown. Use only "
"when the VM is unresponsive."
msgstr "**Destroy** encerra imediatamente a VM sem desligamento gracioso. Use somente quando a VM estiver sem resposta."

